            "review_title": "Review at Mena Gourmet Market",
            "review_text": "Khoi H\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam116 contributions\n0\nSupermarket... licking your mouth with your hands!\nSep 2026 • Family\nMany people have come to MENAS GOURMET (B1 Floor, VIETJET building 60A Truong Son, Tan Son Hoa Ward, HCMC) - almost having the same feeling as me when using the dining service here. It's unimaginable in an urban center, selling food many times more expensive than Coopmax supermarket for on-site consumption, with no napkins, no toothpicks... sales staff with a \"charitable\" attitude towards customers (maybe they think their salary is printed by the supermarket owner and given to them?). So with the service of the ANNAM GOURMET chain, it's like between civilization and... the jungle!\nRead more\nValue for money\nGuide\nMeeting or pickup\nTranslated from Vietnamese\nShow original\nWritten September 1, 2026",
